// DIP: high-level ParkingLot depends on the FeeCalculator abstraction, not a concrete class
interface FeeCalculator { BigDecimal calculate(ParkingTicket t); }

class ParkingLot {
    private final FeeCalculator fee;                 // abstraction
    ParkingLot(FeeCalculator fee) { this.fee = fee; } // injected
}
// OCP: add weekend pricing without editing ParkingLot
class WeekendFeeCalculator implements FeeCalculator {
    public BigDecimal calculate(ParkingTicket t) { /* new rule */ return BigDecimal.TEN; }
}
```
*New pricing = new class (Open/Closed); the lot depends on the interface (Dependency Inversion).*

